=Write tonight's WhatsApp cash report for the owner of YOUR BUSINESS NAME from these exact numbers (₹):
{{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 1) }}

Format: first line '📊 Cash report {{ $json.date }}'. Then 4-6 short lines: sales and number of bills, UPI vs cash vs card, total spent and the biggest expense, net for the day, and cash that should be in the drawer (cash_in minus cash_out). End with ONE practical observation. Use ₹ with Indian commas. Use only these numbers; never invent or estimate. If there were no sales, say so plainly. Output only the message.
